From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 23:26:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Round interface controls and media surfaces

- Increase radii across controls, panels, forms and menus
- Make avatars circular and refine compact button hit areas
- Create seamless, full-width media galleries and video layouts
- Tighten composer uploads and improve visualiser contrast
- Standardise modal, notice and expandable panel corners

Rationale: Establishes a cohesive rounded visual language while improving media presentation and touch-friendly interaction areas. These layout-focused refinements enhance usability without changing application behaviour.

